{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14401","headline":"江行 · 戴叔伦","name":"江行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"漾舟晴川里，挂席候风生。\n临泛何容与，爱此江水清。\n芦洲隐遥嶂，露日映孤城。\n自顾疎野性，屡忘鸥鸟情。\n聊复於时顾，暂欲解尘缨。\n驱驰非吾愿，虚怀浩已盈。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"戴叔伦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14401.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14401","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}